{"title":"2025 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_(Intuitive)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick,_fast,_easy!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick, fast, easy!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lucius is counting backward by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s. His first three numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c6169a64f8271966651402df19345f38ae0c4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is his <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d743d0708fd984f1462c77f3e81bfafdfbdccf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 37 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 42 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 44 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/8/cc8662e5e17e58e2d5147510d2678313f6c9d111.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=100, d=-7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dcc1b21210db29332b1a7d9ce088fd457f23aeee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> into the formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/6325b667ae06013b0d611cdc6814cd202d7cbac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\" /> for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of an arithmetic sequence whose first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9a58767bf187d616dbd8d302ee4ff149cc4755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-7(10-1) = \\boxed{\\text{(B)\\ 37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"206\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Soupboy0\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we want to find the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th number Lucius says after he says <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is subtracted from his number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/e/e1e3fd2fbcf2fa7ca73392d9fe010fc990328017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-(9 \\cdot 7) = \\boxed{\\text{(B)\\ 37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Sigmacuber\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Brute_force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brute force\">brute force</a> and counting backward by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8b44891e006e2d24cb86d697a8bededd8d13757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100, 93, 86, 79, 72, 65, 58, 51, 44, \\boxed{\\text{(B)\\ 37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"305\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>Note that this solution is not practical and very time-consuming.\n</p><p>~codegirl2013, athreyay\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This can be thought of as an arithmetic sequence. Knowing that our first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, we have to add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get to our  0th term, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f80dfbc9746e655daa9ad26bf1e7cc378b8593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$107$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Our answer is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7f22d4619273ef22eb72b166426de827215a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$107 - 10 \\cdot 7 = \\boxed{\\text{(B)\\ 37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"174\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Kapurnicus, NYCnerd\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Setting this as a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/4333164b7126d629e9ac99cf2cf706caada836ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f (x)= 100- 7(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" /> where x is the xth number, we can plug in 10 for x. Quick arithmetic gives us the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb7937e761286188f6961e75aa784ff4e4b5a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)\\ 37}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~themathkidwoohooooo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu.be/rjd0gigUsd0\">~Thesmartgreekmathdude</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5Jak6VUDojA\">https://youtu.be/5Jak6VUDojA</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_.28Intuitive.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_(Intuitive)\">Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Continuum Math (Intuitive)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mBYYaoPQsbs?&amp;t=105\">https://youtu.be/mBYYaoPQsbs?&amp;t=105</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=ilwHCLbBFX8M2bOQ&amp;t=413\">https://youtu.be/VUL0T0YEAHk?si=ilwHCLbBFX8M2bOQ&amp;t=413</a>\n~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\">Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rf5c9ulMA2I\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rf5c9ulMA2I</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillThingz&#160;:)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.youtube.com/jTTcscvcQmI\">SpreadTheMathLove</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//youtu